1255037208_2302763727501136695_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6oloiHZFDUcQ7kNvwHPL4yH&_nc_oc=Adl5NpEFwJ2Ks7ZnDXPjWhUG-wYnRM8LC99L1MdFBQW5gOZS1odFoEFWDY5wI4RI7sM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxNezwpGCG2JQfm2TUdzFxb2seM_CAckOVvvMsFAyDmWA&oe=69AC0647"}, {"file_name": "Main_Custom..._12.05.2025_19-50-37.png", "id": "762247262895327", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822581_762247269561993_927212370882782938_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=st10AQQfAkoQ7kNvwEs4T7R&_nc_oc=AdkTsLc-x4BLjgc9lPB9vaxYJJsbASMYn6iGo52XU2zSU1fHUEUucvOJ8TA-NzF4Hic&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx-4x-TQDnvbU8-OYjw5zLrF8KOi9ymtmGEHUi8RlfanQ&oe=69AC1215"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Banana Game!", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\ud83c\udf4c Banana Game \u2013 A Gorilla Tag Fan Game\nWelcome to Banana Game, a chaotic, high-energy VR experience where you run, jump, and climb just like a monkey\u2014no joysticks, just pure movement! Inspired by Gorilla Tag, this fan-made game takes everything you love and throws in a big pile of bananas, new maps, game modes, and a wild community.\n\nClimb walls, swing through trees, and dodge slippery banana traps as you chase or escape your friends in fast-paced tag matches. Customize your monkey, unlock silly cosmetics, and explore jungles, cities, and banana-themed madness.\n\n\ud83e\udd8d Movement-based locomotion\n\ud83c\udf4c Banana traps and power-ups\n\ud83c\udf10 Multiplayer chaos\n\ud83c\udfad Cosmetic customization\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Unique, community-inspired maps\n\nNo rules. No limits. Just monkey business.\nCan you become the top banana?", "short_description": "\ud83c\udf4c Banana Game \u2013 A Gorilla Tag Fan Game\n\nClimb walls, swing through trees, and dodge slippery banana traps as you chase or escape your friends in fast-paced tag matches. Customize your monkey, unlock 